Ported onto orion2re v2.0.0 in scratch (work order 242 e) from local ee844b0b:
Kill_Missile half by hand (guard on the event). The merge half is not needed on v2: Merge_Missile returns after the first merge and returns early for an empty slot (type <= WEAPON_NO_WEAPONS), so the loop cannot match empty slots after the kill.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/game/cmbtmis.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/game/cmbtmis.cpp b/src/game/cmbtmis.cpp
index 78afb02d..b2a55ab7 100755
--- a/src/game/cmbtmis.cpp
+++ b/src/game/cmbtmis.cpp
@@ -1417,6 +1417,7 @@ namespace CMBTMIS {
 
     void __cdecl Kill_Missile(int16_t missile_idx) {
 #ifdef ORION2RE_EXT
+        if (MOX::missile[missile_idx].type > WEAPON_NO_WEAPONS)  // OrionLayer, open fix 63. An empty slot killed again is no missile gone.
         ext::Combat_Event(ext::CEV_MISSILE_GONE, missile_idx, MOX::missile[missile_idx].type, MOX::missile[missile_idx].quantity, MOX::missile[missile_idx].x, MOX::missile[missile_idx].y);  // OrionLayer, open fix 56.
 #endif
         incoming_valid[missile_idx] = false;
